  "description": "建構在官方 HttpClientFactory 與 DelegatingHandler 之上的 HTTP 管線,取代 RestSharp / Flurl / Polly 這類第三方函式庫:順序固定的簽章、加權多桶限流、冪等感知重試與脫敏日誌四段處理器。簽章以有序參數容器杜絕字典列舉順序造成的隨機失敗,限流建於官方 System.Threading.RateLimiting 之上並以 TimeProvider 驅動,重試僅對安全方法或明確標記為冪等的請求生效並尊重 Retry-After。所有預期失敗以 Result<T> 表達而非例外。除 Microsoft 官方套件與 Ozakboy.* 自研套件外,零第三方相依。A signing, rate-limiting, retry, and log-masking DelegatingHandler pipeline built on the official HttpClientFactory, replacing third-party libraries such as RestSharp, Flurl, and Polly. Ordered query containers keep signatures deterministic, rate limiting is driven by TimeProvider for testability, retries apply only to safe or explicitly idempotent requests, and expected failures are returned as Result<T> rather than thrown.",
